This static review makes no content, catalog-stage, Git, native, or publication approval. Before these methods run, the new classification source set, saved index, captured bounded classifier result, independent content GO, fresh ownership/runtime boundary, and exact stage invocation still require their later separate gates. The root alone executes catalog/Git/SSH actions.
